WEBVTT

1
00:00:16,750 --> 00:00:18,550
All caught in this net are dragonhead fish

2
00:00:18,550 --> 00:00:20,350
Proves that the black eagle group has left

3
00:00:20,350 --> 00:00:22,350
A pound of dragonhead fish only costs three or four cents.

4
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:24,150
It's a pity that it can't be sold at a high price

5
00:00:24,150 --> 00:00:25,550
If I move faster

6
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:28,340
Maybe we can catch a few more nets

7
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:29,340
But it's okay

8
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:30,940
Even if we only cast six nets ahead

9
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:33,740
This time I went overseas and got at least 400 pounds of black eagles.

10
00:00:33,740 --> 00:00:37,220
nearly one dollar

11
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:38,620
This means going to sea today

12
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:39,820
Get at least 400 yuan

13
00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:44,080
What should I do? There is no milk at home.

14
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:45,680
How about I make some more rice soup for her to drink?

15
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:47,080
With this 400 yuan

16
00:00:47,080 --> 00:00:48,880
Don't talk about buying sea chicken and fish for Liu Xiaoyue

17
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:50,880
Just let Sanya drink high-end milk powder every day

18
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:51,880
What are you stepping on again?

19
00:00:56,130 --> 00:00:57,130
These people want to destroy the ship

20
00:00:57,130 --> 00:00:58,530
Drive into a nearby safe haven

21
00:00:58,530 --> 00:00:59,530
When the typhoon comes

22
00:00:59,530 --> 00:01:00,730
The ship can only stay flat there

23
00:01:00,730 --> 00:01:02,530
Only in this way can we avoid the big storm and stay safe.

24
00:01:02,530 --> 00:01:12,300
Fortunately, the boat dad left behind is big enough.

25
00:01:12,300 --> 00:01:13,330
No matter how important it is

26
00:01:13,330 --> 00:01:14,620
compared to some small boats

27
00:01:14,620 --> 00:01:16,060
It's still a lot safer

28
00:01:16,060 --> 00:01:17,460
I will follow you all now

29
00:01:17,460 --> 00:01:19,060
Get the ship into a safe harbor as soon as possible

30
00:01:19,060 --> 00:01:21,460
It’s better to take advantage of the big wave and try again.

31
00:01:21,460 --> 00:01:22,560
I swear

32
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:24,260
From today on, I will change my ways

33
00:01:24,260 --> 00:01:25,360
Become a new person

34
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:26,460
I go fishing

35
00:01:26,460 --> 00:01:27,360
make big money

36
00:01:27,360 --> 00:01:28,860
I guarantee you will be popular in the future

37
00:01:28,860 --> 00:01:29,860
Spicy drink

38
00:01:29,860 --> 00:01:34,780
It will take at least three or four hours for the typhoon to strike.

39
00:01:34,780 --> 00:01:35,980
But riding a motorcycle

40
00:01:35,980 --> 00:01:37,680
Let's cast one last net before leaving.

41
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:38,780
Even if they are all dragon fish

42
00:01:38,780 --> 00:01:44,980
I admit it too

43
00:01:44,980 --> 00:01:47,480
Ships bound for safe havens will also cast nets on the way

44
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:48,580
Go against them

45
00:01:48,580 --> 00:01:50,380
The chance of getting an orifice will be higher.
